  "configuration_id": "config_019",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA multiprofile avgpool with PCA is strong, and adding ResNet50 image features with concat fusion gives the current best result, but image-only ResNet50 is weak, so the value and combination of the image branch remain uncertain. config_019 changes only fusion from concat to weighted in the current best setting, isolating the fusion effect. It tests whether weighted fusion can improve on concat by better balancing RNA and image signals, or whether concat is already sufficient. This is a low-risk, one-factor extension of the most promising direction and efficiently reduces uncertainty before exploring larger changes such as new image encoders."
}

